'''Shadowlord's Research''' can be acquired from [[Noppsy Spickerspan]] after the completion of {{questlong|Alliance|32|Harrowing News}}. It is a translation of the [[Stormreaver Scroll]] taken from [[Shadowlord Ar'kor]].

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Our progress is undeniable. The essence drained from these spineless vermin grows with each successful experiment. Soon we will have enough to usher in a new age for the Stormreaver. Our masters in the ordained halls will open the rift and allow the true overlords to enter this rotten world. All thanks to the Bloodstone. [[Nagaz]] did excellent in securing it from these foolish human mages, like hapless whelps did they try understanding the great power of this almighty relic.

Soon [[Mergothid|Mergothid the All-Seeing]] will grace us with his presence. We will bask in his glory and eradicate the non-believers in the name of the Master!
}}

