[[File:Servitor's Sanctuary.png|thumb|300px]]
The '''Servitor's Sanctuary''' is a [[draenei]] village in [[Moonwhisper Coast]] inhabited by the [[Fallen Ones]] led by [[Elder Bhu'robi]]. It was established when Bhu'robi left the [[Moro'gai tribe]] with his followers, dissatisfied with [[Moro'gai K'la]]'s failing leadership. When an arcane meteor fell from the skies at [[Starshard Cradle]], part of the sanctuary was caught in the blast.<ref>[[Writings of the Elder]]</ref>

